OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's services praised for
OL,4,Aimprovement after damning report
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn improvement notice on Liverpool's
OL,7,Fchildren's services has been formally
OL,8,Flifted by the government.
OL,10,FIt comes three years after the city
OL,11,Fcouncil's children's services were
OL,12,Frated as "inadequate" by education and
OL,13,Fchildren's social care watchdog Ofsted
OL,14,Fin a damning inspection report and
OL,15,Fplaced in special measures.
OL,17,FAn Ofsted inspection earlier this year
OL,18,Ffound they were "good" in three out of
OL,19,Ffour areas.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
